        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your hair becomes lightning and your wings arc white.</p><p>You gain a <strong>fly Speed</strong> equal to your Speed and <strong>electricity immunity</strong>, and:</p><ul><li>You emit a <strong>10-foot emanation</strong> of live current. A creature that ends its turn in it takes @Damage[3d6[electricity]] damage (basic Reflex).</li><li>Once per round when you hit with your spirit weapon, arcs jump: one other creature within 15 feet of the target takes <strong>3d6 electricity</strong> (basic Reflex).</li></ul>"
